# Wireframe: Reconnection Toast

## Purpose & Flow Context

The Reconnection Toast appears when the WebSocket connection drops or reconnection fails, providing the user with status information and optional retry action. Entry: connection failure detected. Exit: user dismisses toast or it auto-dismisses after 5 seconds.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

## Accessibility — Shared Conventions

All interactive screens inherit these. Per-screen specifics noted where they diverge.

| Concern | Convention |
|---------|------------|
| Landmarks | `header`, `main`, `aside`, `contentinfo` |
| Heading order | One `h1` per screen, `h2` for sections |
| Accessible names | Icon-only controls get `aria-label` |
| Keyboard | Tab, Enter/Space, Escape, Arrow keys |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px reservation |
| Non-color intent | Icon + text, never color alone |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: Toast is positioned fixed, not part of grid layout.

**App-shell**: Toast overlays content, positioned bottom-right.

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Toast Container | Warning icon, message text, retry button, dismiss button | Fixed position, bottom-right, z-index high |

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                                                                    |
|                                                                    |
|                                                                    |
|                                                                    |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
|  |  ⚠  Connection lost. Reconnecting...  [Retry]  [X]        |  |
|  +------------------------------------------------------------+  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [#Heading] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Warning Icon | Icon | Visual indicator of warning state | None |
| Message Text | Text | Describes connection issue | Truncates if too long |
| Retry Button | Button | Click triggers manual reconnection | Disabled during reconnection |
| Dismiss Button | Button | Click closes toast | Keyboard accessible via Escape |

## Data Display

This is a notification toast, not a data display screen. It displays connection status information.

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Warning Icon | Visual warning indicator | ⚠️ triangle icon |
| Message Text | Communicates connection issue | "Connection lost. Reconnecting...", "Unable to connect. Check your network." |
| Retry Button | Offers manual reconnection | "Retry", "Reconnect" |
| Dismiss Button | Allows user to dismiss | [X] icon or "Dismiss" text |

## States

### Visible (Connection Lost)

Toast appears with warning icon, message, and retry button.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ⚠  Connection lost. Reconnecting...  [Retry]  [X]        |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Visible (Max Retries Exhausted)

Toast appears with error icon, message, and retry button.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ⚠  Unable to connect. Please check your network.  [Retry]  [X] |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Visible (Network Failure)

Toast appears with network error message.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ⚠  Network error. Reconnect when online.  [Retry]  [X]   |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Dismissed

Toast slides out to right and is removed from DOM.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|  (empty - toast has slid out)                               |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Loading (Reconnection in Progress)

Retry button shows loading spinner, disabled.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ⚠  Reconnecting...  [⟳ Retry]  [X]                       |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full toast with all elements, bottom-right position |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Same as desktop |
| Mobile (<768px) | Toast spans full width at bottom, larger touch targets |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | No landmarks (toast is overlay) |
| Heading order | No headings in toast |
| Reading / Focus order | Focus moves to toast when it appears |
| Accessible names | Retry button: aria-label="Retry connection", Dismiss button: aria-label="Dismiss notification" |
| Keyboard operability | Tab to buttons, Enter/Space activates, Escape dismisses toast |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px on Retry and Dismiss buttons |
| Focus not obscured | Toast doesn't obscure focused element (positioned bottom-right) |
| Non-color intent | Warning icon + text, not just red color |
